  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Linguistics 5 ranks, Communication sphere (Mental Loophole).</p>\n<p>You can use Linguistics to find a loophole in any one spell that allowed a Will saving throw other than a curse. If the spell was mind-affecting, the new save is attempted with a +4 insight bonus. You end the spell if the new saving throw succeeds.</p>\n<p>If you have at least 10 ranks in Linguistics, you can find a loophole in any curse (regardless of whether it allowed a saving throw or what the save was) if you spend 1 minute and a total of 2 uses of skill leverage per target and your Linguistics check succeeds against the DC to dispel it. If the curse did not normally allow a save, the target can attempt a Will saving throw to end it.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc55\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
